This is a high-quality pineapple challenge game based on the core of the big pineapple game.
        1. Brand new pineapple checkpoint mode, get exclusive avatar;
        2. Each level will allow you to learn new card placement skills;
        The first step in the pineapple game is very important. A good start will determine your advantage in the next game; in addition, when you are unlucky, you need to learn to give up forming big cards to ensure that the bottom will not burst, so that the loss will be reduced. To the minimum, you can make a comeback at one time; and accumulating experience in playing cards in the pineapple breakthrough will give you a huge improvement in the actual battle of the big pineapple;
